cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rag-ft-eval: stakeholder-weighted utility analysis for comparing LLM domain-adaptation strategies"
authors:
  - family-names: Nothstein
    given-names: Cecilia
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ceciiliaaa/rag-vs-finetuning-eval"
abstract: >-
  A small, tested Python package and CLI for multi-criteria (utility-analysis) evaluation of
  LLM systems with stakeholder-derived weights, Kendall's W agreement testing and sensitivity
  analysis. Ships a case study comparing retrieval-augmented generation with fine-tuning for
  domain specialisation of GPT-3.5 in a business question-answering setting.
